### Feature Reward — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (status = inactive)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name deleteRewardPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/recompensas/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteRewardLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/recompensas/{{id}}/deactivate
